<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Zoom Mode</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>viewport context menu &gt; Zoom Mode</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">, by pressing</span> <span class="Shortcut" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Shift + Z</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">, or by pressing</span> <span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Zoom</b></span> <span class="Button">mode</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button on the toolbar.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">When this mode is enabled, hold down the left mouse button and move the mouse up or down to zoom in or out. The significant destination for the mouse move can be swapped in</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="Display_Settings_-_On_Rotate_Pan.htm">Preferences / Display / Rotate/Pan/Zoom</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">dialog. Select Zoom in on mouse move up option to zoom in when you move the mouse up and vice versa. Select Zoom in on mouse move down option to zoom in when you move the mouse down and vice versa.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../view_menu/Commands_files/image103.gif" width="32px" height="32px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">Mouse pointer in</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Mode</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Exit</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Mode</span> <span lang="EN-GB">by switching to another one –</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Window</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Mode">Rotate</span><span lang="EN-GB">, or</span> <span class="Mode">Pan</span><span lang="EN-GB">. This mode is not stored so when you open another window,</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Window</span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode will be enabled.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">:</span> Using <span class="Shortcut">Shift + Middle mouse button</span> or only the <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>mouse wheel</b></span> it will always switch to <span class="Mode">Zoom</span> mode<span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
